            "review_title": "Review at Atrium Cafe",
            "review_text": "ECM\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam178 contributions\n0\nDelightful Seafood Dinner Buffet!\nMar 2022\nWe dine to celebrate Woman’s Day Mar 08, 2022 at Atrium Café. \nWe were very happy on the food quality, service and also ambiance.\nThe lobsters were fresh and cooked well. We loved the cheese and pepper sauce!\nThe waiters were also attentive and enough staff are assigned to look after specific areas of the dining floor. Well done on this!\nOur table was overlooking the outdoor swimming pool. Very nice.\nThey also served carvings that evening (ham and beef) which is also good.\nThe variety of seafood items were good from crab, shrimps, oysters and many kinds of shells! \nOur whole dining experience was very good and we will for sure consider to come back in an other occasion.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 9, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
